43
00:02:14,352 --> 00:02:23,207
[...]

44
00:02:23,207 --> 00:02:25,166
En Procedimiento registras cirugías,

45
00:02:25,166 --> 00:02:25,498
[...]

46
00:02:25,498 --> 00:02:26,853
